#: ../../desktop/index.rst:3
msgid "Desktop Client"
msgstr "Client de bureau"

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Nextcloud desktop client for Windows, macOS, and Linux keeps files "
"synchronized between your computer and your Nextcloud server."
msgstr ""
"Le client de bureau Nextcloud pour Windows, macOS et Linux garde les "
"fichiers synchronisés entre votre ordinateur et votre serveur Nextcloud."

